     {
      "text": "Subject Qualification Teaching/Research Experience (common to all subjects) 1 Anatomy Must possess M.S. (Anatomy)/ M.D.(Anatomy)/ MBBS with M.Sc. (Anatomy)/ M.Sc. (Med",
