      "page": 2
     },
     {
      "text": "6 Microbiology Must possess M.D. (Bacteriology)/ M.D.",
      "page": 2
     },
     {
      "text": "7 Community Medicine (SPM) Must possess M.D.(Social & Preventive Medicine) / MD (Community Med.) recognized degree Or equivalent qualification for Community Medicine (SPM) (DNB Community Medicine/ SPM) ** as per MCI’s Teachers Eligibility Qualifications Regulations 1998 including the prevailing…",
      "page": 3
     },
     {
